@page "/nutrition-diary"

<PageTitle>Nutrition Diary</PageTitle>

<section class="page-header">
    <p class="dashboard-label">Nutrition</p>
    <h1>Nutrition Diary</h1>
    <p>
        This page is prepared to connect with the nutrition feature developed by the team.
        It supports the project structure for food search, meal registration, grams consumed,
        meal type selection, and daily nutrition totals.
    </p>
</section>

<section class="feature-grid">
    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>Food Search</h3>
        <p>
            Users can search food items and select the correct record from the nutrition database.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Nutrition database</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🍽️</div>
        <h3>Meal Registration</h3>
        <p>
            Users can register meals such as breakfast, lunch, dinner, or snacks.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Daily tracking</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">⚖️</div>
        <h3>Serving Amount</h3>
        <p>
            The feature can support grams consumed so nutrition totals can be calculated more accurately.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Grams consumed</div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Daily Totals</h3>
        <p>
            The app can display calories, protein, carbohydrates, fat, and other nutrition values.
        </p>
        <div class="goal-pill">Summary view</div>
    </div>
</section>